v2ray-client (1.0.0) focal; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Modern PyQt6-based GUI with three tabs (Servers, Settings, Logs)
  * Support for multiple subscription URLs
  * One-click server connection/disconnection
  * Automatic server list updates with configurable intervals
  * Server ping measurement and sorting
  * Live V2Ray connection logs
  * Multiple themes (Dark, Light, Neon)
  * Country flags and server information display
  * Public IP address display when connected
  * Comprehensive automated testing suite

 -- V2Ray Client Team <support@v2ray-client.local>  Mon, 10 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000
